# システム登録 (design 11.32) on the x64 PC, for tools/x64/ui_run64.py with a second
# NVMe laid out as Windows leaves it (tools/tests/mkwindisk.py make W.img C, given with
# UI_EXTRA="-drive file=W.img,if=none,id=nv2,format=raw -device nvme,serial=win,drive=nv2"):
# the program, a process, lists the disk through the desktop (DT_RQ_SYSINST), looks
# at Windowsと共存する on it, shows what it would do in the panel that asks, and is
# put away with 取消; nothing is written. The copy itself is the kernel's test
# (tests/ktest/x86_64/ktest_sysinst.c).
logmark
open 01a0d8c4-54c0-7a11-8c22-4d5e6f7054c0
expectsincein 60 sysinst: opened 1
# no TessronOS on the disk: 上書きする and 初期化する both greyed
expectsincein 60 sysinst: keep nvmeb 0 -1: -1
waitwin システム登録 30
wait 500
shot sysinst64_open
# 開始: the panel's button, at 506..606, 230..256 of the work area: the window opens in the middle
win システム登録
logmark
click 880 288
expectsincein 60 sysinst: plan nvmeb 0 -1: 0
expectsince sysinst: ask 登録
wait 800
shot sysinst64_ask
key 29
expectsince sysinst: answered 0
wait 300
key 08 01
expectsince sysinst: closed
absent sysinst: started
absent !OACV!
